#!/bin/bash
# HMC-BE EC2 부트스트랩. 인스턴스를 처음 켤 때 한 번만 실행된다. 로그: /var/log/hmc-bootstrap.log
set -euo pipefail
exec > >(tee -a /var/log/hmc-bootstrap.log) 2>&1
echo "[hmc] bootstrap start $(date -u +%FT%TZ)"

# 1) 스왑 파일: 작은 인스턴스에서 JVM과 DB를 함께 돌릴 때 메모리 부족을 완충한다.
%{ if swap_size_gb > 0 ~}
if [ ! -f /swapfile ]; then
  dd if=/dev/zero of=/swapfile bs=1M count=$((${swap_size_gb} * 1024))
  chmod 600 /swapfile
  mkswap /swapfile
  swapon /swapfile
  echo '/swapfile none swap sw 0 0' >> /etc/fstab
fi
%{ endif ~}

# 2) Docker
dnf install -y docker
systemctl enable --now docker
usermod -aG docker ec2-user || true

# 3) Docker Compose 플러그인 (GitHub 릴리스에서 받는다)
mkdir -p /usr/local/lib/docker/cli-plugins
curl -fsSL "https://github.com/docker/compose/releases/download/v${docker_compose_version}/docker-compose-linux-x86_64" \
  -o /usr/local/lib/docker/cli-plugins/docker-compose
chmod +x /usr/local/lib/docker/cli-plugins/docker-compose

# 4) 앱 작업 디렉터리와 환경변수 파일(.env)
mkdir -p /opt/hmc
cd /opt/hmc
if [ ! -f .env ]; then
  umask 077
  cat > .env <<ENV
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DB_NAME=hmc
DB_USERNAME=hmc
DB_PASSWORD=$(openssl rand -hex 24)

REDIS_HOST=localhost
REDIS_PORT=6379

AWS_REGION=${region}
AWS_S3_BUCKET=${s3_bucket}

OAUTH2_ISSUER_URI=
FIREBASE_CREDENTIALS_PATH=
LOKI_URL=
ENV
fi

# 5) PostgreSQL(PostGIS) + Redis: 이 인스턴스 안에서만 접근 가능하다(127.0.0.1에만 바인딩).
%{ if bootstrap_data_services ~}
cat > docker-compose.yml <<'COMPOSE'
services:
  postgres:
    image: postgis/postgis:16-3.4
    container_name: hmc-postgres
    restart: unless-stopped
    environment:
      POSTGRES_DB: $${DB_NAME}
      POSTGRES_USER: $${DB_USERNAME}
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: $${DB_PASSWORD}
    ports:
      - "127.0.0.1:5432:5432"
    volumes:
      - postgres-data:/var/lib/postgresql/data

  redis:
    image: redis:7-alpine
    container_name: hmc-redis
    restart: unless-stopped
    ports:
      - "127.0.0.1:6379:6379"

volumes:
  postgres-data:
COMPOSE
docker compose up -d
%{ endif ~}

echo "[hmc] bootstrap done $(date -u +%FT%TZ)"
